    "excerpt": "Getting the bedside device and desktop dashboard working was not the end. This part covers how we connected Smart IV to AWS, built the mobile application, and dealt with certificates, MQTT topics, authentication, data formats and the end-to-end integration problems that appear only when every layer is finally connected.",
