    "thumbnail": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600132806370-bf17e65e942f?w=600&q=80",
    "excerpt": "Once the architecture was clear enough, we had to make Smart IV work physically. This part covers the drop sensor, motorized tube control, power circuit, interface, and the hardware changes that only became obvious after actually building and testing the device.",
    "references": [],
